      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在经历了无数艰辛、超越了自身的极限后……\n在终点亲手攫取的胜利，才具有耀眼的光芒――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f193eb8a921ef165f34662a519d87695e00242d3215fe2c7f83fb0dc8f9bc470",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
