    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e57a4fedaa30ac7616f957",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而是一旦松懈就会在瞬间被绊倒……\n必须削减生命与灵魂去拼命飞驰的、\n这片赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a0d3e48b0344e3e1f766d14d5233b8b54d1edfae99943f859331bfcfef264c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5081af1d91e7c219550af28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那我们就来为下一场比赛制定计划吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b800e5277f2f0be0a3d094fc0c07215c727ce0acc3e0f253291181d453995078",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
